OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle large
OL,4,Ascrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have spent the night
OL,7,Ftackling a large fire at a scrapyard in
OL,8,FBarnsley.
OL,10,FFootage shared on social media showed
OL,11,Fhuge plumes of black smoke billowing
OL,12,Facross the sky from the blaze in
OL,13,FBoulder Bridge Lane, Carlton.
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,16,Fsaid it was called to the area on
OL,17,FSaturday evening, with 10 engines, an
OL,18,Faerial ladder platform and a number of
OL,19,Foperational support vehicles deployed
OL,20,Fto the scene at its peak.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
