OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle large
OL,4,Ascrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the fire involved quantities of
OL,7,Fscrap metal and tyres, and advised
OL,8,Fpeople living nearby to keep their
OL,9,Fwindows and doors closed, adding that
OL,10,Fcrews were expected to be on scene
OL,11,Fthroughout Sunday morning.
